iply $ x \\cdot (x + 1) = x^2 + x $\n- Subtract:\n\n$$\n(x^2 - 3) - (x^2 + x) = -x - 3\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 8: Divide $ -x $ by $ x $\n\n- $ -x \\div x = -1 $\n- Multiply $ -1 \\cdot (x + 1) = -x - 1 $\n- Subtract:\n\n$$\n(-x - 3) - (-x - 1) = -2\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 9: Final result\n\nWe have now completed the division. The **quotient** is:\n\n$$\nx^5 - x^4 + x^3 - x^2 + x - 1\n$$\n\nAnd the **remainder** is $ -2 $.\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{x^5 - x^4 + x^3 - x^2 + x - 1}\n$$", "draft_calls": 793, "input_ids": [151644, 872, 198, 9885, 279, 74762, 979, 400, 87, 61, 21, 481, 220, 18, 3, 374, 17779, 553, 400, 87, 488, 220, 16, 2418, 198, 5501, 2874, 3019, 553, 3019, 11, 323, 2182, 697, 1590, 4226, 2878, 1124, 79075, 46391, 151645, 198, 151644, 77091, 198, 151667, 271, 151668, 271], "input_tokens": 49, "method": "sd2_selected", "output_hash": "5d899497e8bfac09f44dedc31b21c5bae2e450ff7fc62bf65e2236663f4c6a9f", "output_ids": [1654, 525, 4588, 311, 1477, 279, 3070, 13492, 1167, 334, 979, 279, 47311, 400, 856, 61, 21, 481, 220, 18, 400, 374, 17779, 553, 400, 856, 488, 220, 16, 400, 382, 44364, 14374, 14822, 220, 16, 25, 5443, 75153, 5724, 14489, 271, 1654, 1366, 311, 21749, 1447, 14085, 198, 87, 61, 21, 481, 220, 18, 1124, 611, 320, 87, 488, 220, 16, 340, 14085, 271, 10061, 748, 2736, 3070, 9896, 25358, 1293, 12804, 334, 382, 44364, 14374, 14822, 220, 17, 25, 2573, 705, 279, 12804, 271, 1654, 21749, 400, 856, 61, 21, 481, 220, 18, 400, 553, 400, 856, 488, 220, 16, 400, 382, 1654, 646, 3270, 419, 438, 1447, 14085, 198, 59, 37018, 45340, 61, 21, 481, 220, 18, 15170, 87, 488, 220, 16, 532, 14085, 271, 1654, 686, 2736, 279, 12804, 3019, 553, 3019, 382, 44364, 14374, 14822, 220, 18, 25, 62902, 400, 856, 61, 21, 400, 553, 400, 856, 84500, 12, 400, 856, 61, 21, 1124, 611, 856, 284, 856, 61, 20, 24437, 12, 71059, 400, 856, 61, 20, 1124, 50853, 320, 87, 488, 220, 16, 8, 284, 856, 61, 21, 488, 856, 61, 20, 24437, 12, 93210, 504, 279, 4024, 47311, 1447, 14